{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07671","headline":"从张丞相游南纪城猎戏赠裴迪张参军 · 孟浩然","name":"从张丞相游南纪城猎戏赠裴迪张参军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从禽非吾乐，不好云梦田。\n岁暮登城望，偏令相思悬。\n公卿有几几，车骑何翩翩。\n世禄金张贵，官曹幕府贤。\n顺时行杀气，飞刃争割鲜。\n十里届宾馆，徵声匝妓筵。\n高标回落日，平楚散芳烟。\n何意狂歌客，从公亦在旃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07671.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07671","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}